# {{place|en|river|in southern [[England]], flowing 336 [[km]] (209 [[mile|mi.]]) from|co/Gloucestershire|through|co/Wiltshire|co/Oxfordshire|co/Berkshire|co/Buckinghamshire|co/Surrey|and|co/Greater London}} to the {{w|Thames Estuary}} and {{l|en|North Sea}}.
# A [[sea area]] centred on the {{w|Thames Estuary}}.
